## Description

Swyx (Shawn Wang) reveals how the AI Engineer World's Fair scaled from a 500-person meetup to 7,200+ attendees — plus the Token Billionaire club and the plan to go global.

Guest: Swyx (Shawn Wang), co-founder & CEO at AI Engineer
